source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A run of two or more escapes nothing behind it, so Jira shows three backslashes and a literal asterisk; jiro keeps all four characters.
-- input.jira --
a\\\*b
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\\*b</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\\\\*b
-- warnings.json --
[]
